<title>ITALY: Italy MontePaschi bank H1 96 cons profit up 90 pct.</title>
<headline>Italy MontePaschi bank H1 96 cons profit up 90 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian banking group  Monte dei Paschi di Siena said its first half 1996 consolidated profit had risen 90 percent over the same 1995 period to 125 billion lire. It gave no comparison.</p>
<p>It said in a statement its net interest income fell 4.87 percent to 1.76 trillion lire but operating income rose 7.26 percent to 2.84 trillion lire.</p>
<p>Client deposits rose 6.69 percent to 80.87 trillion lire while client credits rose 4.77 percent to 66.82 trillion.</p>
<p>-- Rome newsroom +392 66129589</p>
</text>
